<main class="zd-roadmap">

  <section class="zd-roadmap-hero">
    <div class="zd-roadmap-hero__image">
      <img
        src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/ADBb0uhgSHqbo6nu-0Go7YBrpfPkciNm5mzoE8p2B5uE7CaejQKBbmAjVgCTA6jyizs4LPTIqRf4wcFvf4FmVyBg0hPx9ASUMFg0vT9WCji1x_WqWhFtilHZixqi-kdgOuT1KmrdL-w7yGWepZQNFgUeVIiFj7v2BFUwPgpmXcTWgKn949TeE1JqOAcIoGw-b3bABScdMKtObfyhzXjnPKA1UINlL-sOJxGjleQHSP5kSyPOT1SeV2gPWFrdwWCf"
        alt="Architecture of Intent"
        width="1800"
        height="1000"
      >
      <div class="zd-roadmap-hero__fade"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="zd-roadmap-hero__content">
      <span>The Evolution</span>
      <h1>Architecture of Intent.</h1>
      <p>
        Tracing the trajectory of our ecosystem. From foundational visual systems
        to deeply integrated life-design platforms.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zd-roadmap-phases">
    <article>
      <span>Phase 00: Past</span>
      <div>
        <i></i>
        <h2>The Genesis</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Defining the Ziyu manifesto and the core philosophy of intentional technology.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="is-current">
      <span>Phase 01: Current</span>
      <div>
        <i></i>
        <h2>Goal Grower Beta</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Closed beta testing with early supporters. Shaping the future of habit growth.</p>
    </article>

    <article>
      <span>Phase 02: Future</span>
      <div>
        <i></i>
        <h2>Ziyu 2.0</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Official global launch and digital intent bridge. A unified ecosystem for deep living.</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="zd-roadmap-filter">
    <div class="zd-roadmap-tabs">
      <button class="is-active" data-filter="all">All</button>
      <button data-filter="past">Past</button>
      <button data-filter="current">Current</button>
      <button data-filter="future">Future</button>
    </div>

    <div class="zd-roadmap-legend">
      <span><i class="dot-app"></i> App</span>
      <span><i class="dot-marketing"></i> Marketing</span>
      <span><i class="dot-products"></i> Products</span>
      <span><i class="dot-other"></i> Other</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zd-roadmap-timeline">
    <div class="zd-roadmap-line">

      <article class="zd-roadmap-item" data-phase="past">
        <time>2022</time>
        <div class="zd-roadmap-dot"></div>
        <div>
          <div class="zd-roadmap-item__top">
            <span class="badge completed">Completed</span>
            <i class="dot-other"></i>
            <h3>Manifesto Development</h3>
          </div>
          <p>Core research and foundational philosophy documentation for the Ziyu ecosystem.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="zd-roadmap-item" data-phase="past">
        <time>2023</time>
        <div class="zd-roadmap-dot"></div>
        <div>
          <div class="zd-roadmap-item__top">
            <span class="badge completed">Completed</span>
            <i class="dot-marketing"></i>
            <h3>Visual Identity 1.0</h3>
          </div>
          <p>Designing the “Aura &amp; Intent” design system and initial web presence.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="zd-roadmap-item" data-phase="current">
        <time>Q3 2024</time>
        <div class="zd-roadmap-dot current"></div>
        <div>
          <div class="zd-roadmap-item__top">
            <span class="badge progress">In Progress</span>
            <i class="dot-app"></i>
            <h3>Goal Grower Beta</h3>
          </div>
          <p>Active testing of our bio-mimetic habit tracker with the core community.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="zd-roadmap-item" data-phase="current">
        <time>Q4 2024</time>
        <div class="zd-roadmap-dot current"></div>
        <div>
          <div class="zd-roadmap-item__top">
            <span class="badge progress">In Progress</span>
            <i class="dot-app"></i>
            <h3>Community Gardens</h3>
          </div>
          <p>Collective motivation engines and shared accountability clusters.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="zd-roadmap-item" data-phase="future">
        <time>2025</time>
        <div class="zd-roadmap-dot"></div>
        <div>
          <div class="zd-roadmap-item__top">
            <span class="badge planned">Planned</span>
            <i class="dot-products"></i>
            <h3>Blokkr Integration</h3>
          </div>
          <p>Hardened focus protocols and distraction shielding for digital deep work. Our flagship focus utility.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="zd-roadmap-item" data-phase="future">
        <time>2025</time>
        <div class="zd-roadmap-dot"></div>
        <div>
          <div class="zd-roadmap-item__top">
            <span class="badge planned">Planned</span>
            <i class="dot-app"></i>
            <h3>Kindlitt Alpha</h3>
          </div>
          <p>A sanctuary for information. Clean reading experience and deep knowledge curation.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="zd-roadmap-item" data-phase="future">
        <time>2026</time>
        <div class="zd-roadmap-dot"></div>
        <div>
          <div class="zd-roadmap-item__top">
            <span class="badge planned">Planned</span>
            <i class="dot-products"></i>
            <h3>MyJourney Ecosystem</h3>
          </div>
          <p>Full-spectrum life design system integrating planning and deep reflection cycles.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zd-roadmap-cta">
    <h2>Support moves the roadmap forward</h2>
    <p>Join our community of intentional users helping us build a more mindful digital future.</p>
    <a href="/pages/support">Support the Mission →</a>
  </section>

</main>

